  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Sleeping Arrangements <br>Two Story Unit | Master Bedroom, King Bed; Guest Bedroom 1, King Bed; Guest Bedroom 2, King Bed; Guest Bedroom 3, Queen Bed; Guest Bedroom 4, Full Bunk Bed and Twin Sleeper<br><br>Parking: This property provides two driveway parking spots, offering guests direct access to the unit.<br><br>From the exterior where you'll have the choice of 2 golf carts to cruise the resort, you know you’re in for something really special. That's right--this home comes with 2 golf carts for you to enjoy--a white 6-seater and a yellow 4-seater for plenty of space for 10 people. Nestled away on the Bay side of the SANDESTIN GOLF AND BEACH RESORT®, this home sits along the canal in the over-the-top community of Villa Lago. Each home offers its own take blending a Tuscan feel with our Panhandle Florida charm. The Tuscan feel is noticed right away with the tiled roof, stucco exterior, and columns around the porches. Inside, beautifully tiled floors lead you through the very open floor plan which is made even more spacious by the lofty ceilings. <br> <br>The kitchen will “wow” any cook in your group! The granite countertops and appliances are all brand new as this home was just completed in 2016. There is plenty of counter space and even more storage, perfect for whipping up a simple snack to enjoy on the patio or pack up something for everyone and create a sunset picnic – Tuscan-style! The large living space has plenty of seating for relaxing and recharging until your next adventure. There is even a first-floor half bath for extra convenience.<br> <br>Aside from the main master bedroom and full en suite bathroom on the 1st floor, the second floor hosts 4 of the home’s five bedrooms. There are two additional master suites which each offer their own en suite, private bathrooms. Both are beautifully tiled with double vanities and walk-in showers. The main master suite has a separate Jacuzzi tub and shower. The fourth bedroom has a queen bed and an en suite bathroom with a walk-in shower. The fifth bedroom is perfect for the kids with a set of full-size bunk beds, a twin sleeper, and an en suite bathroom with a tub/shower combo.<br> <br>Hop on one of the home’s golf carts or ready your bike and start your exploration of the beautiful resort where, from your doorstep, you’re just a few minutes away from resort life at its best! <br><br>Guest Walk-Through <br>Two Story Unit – Kitchen, Living Room, Dining Room, 5 Bedrooms, 5.5 Bathrooms<br><br>Unit Amenities- 2 Golf Carts, Laundry, Keurig, Propane Grill, High-Speed Wifi, 50\" Smart TV's in all Bedrooms, 3 Doors Down from the Pool, Driveway Parking for 2 Cars<br>Community Amenities- Community Pool<br>Resort Amenities- Gated Community, Multiple Pools, Resort Tram, Fitness Center/Spa/Salon, Golf, Tennis, Marina, Shops, Restaurants, Entertainment, Private Beach, Watersports<br><br>About the Community of Villa Lago<br>Villa Lago is the latest addition to the Resort offering single-family 3-, 4- and 5-bedroom homes with Mediterranean-style and resort comforts. Enjoy amenities such as the community pool and the first-class dining and entertainment options of the Village of Baytowne Wharf. Most properties have either a lake or golf course view. Rent with us today and discover what a truly relaxing and carefree vacation feels like at Villa Lago.<br><br>Local Favorites<br>MVH guests receive savings with our Local Favorites. Enjoy discounts to restaurants, beach activities, and shopping so you can save while you stay.<br><br>MVH Beach Closet <br>This property offers a Beach Closet stocked with complimentary beach chairs and an umbrella for use during your stay.<br><br>MVH Rental Restrictions<br>Please reference the Rental Restrictions and Terms of Use.<br> <br>SANDESTIN® is a federally registered trademark owned by Sandestin Investments, LLC (“SI”). My Vacation Haven, LLC is an independent entity and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or associated with SI. Any use or reference to SI or its trademarks is solely to identify a property and not to suggest any affiliation with SI.",
