    "description": [
      "Located near the beach, this vacation home is in Villa Lago, a neighborhood in Miramar Beach. Big Kahuna's Water and Adventure Park is a popular attraction and the area's natural beauty can be seen at Miramar Beach and Destin Beaches. Blast Arcade and Laser Maze and Sirens at the Beach are also worth visiting. Be sure to check out the area's animals with activities such as game walks and birdwatching."
